      "text": "[9:07PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic from Tinubu Square connecting Nnamdi Azikiwe Street enroute Tom Jones intersection is good at this hour.\nOyebanji intersection connecting Adeniji Adele Road has finally subsided.\nTraffic inward journey Police Post via Oba's Palace is moving as expected, no cause for alarm.\nIlubinrin connecting Carter Bridge and descending to Ebuta Ero through Eja Lonibu and Leventies is good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
