      "text": "[9:19PM] #Iju_Ishaga #TrafficUpdate \n\nJonathan Coker is good down to Amala Junction, and the return journey is also smooth.\nIju Road down to Agege Pen Cinema is fast now, and the return journey back to College Traffic Light is also good.\nThe stretch of College Road, Idi Agbon, Orimolade, Haruna, Oyemekun down to Yaya Abatan is still looking good at this time, and Ajayi is also smooth.\nThe stretch returning back to Jungle is a smooth one, enroute Fagba is fast now down to Ishaga Roundabout.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
